        "statement": "Boise Metal Works was founded in 1994 by [redacted] and [redacted], originating from Boise Spring Works.",
        "label": "fact",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.boisemetalworks.com/idaho-master-metal-fabricators-history/",
        "quote": "[redacted] ([redacted]’s grandson) and [redacted] ([redacted] Son) had the idea that they could leverage their metal smithing reputation and start a new journey"
      },
      {
        "statement": "The business serves Boise, Meridian, Eagle, Nampa, Caldwell, and Eastern Oregon.",
        "label": "fact",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.boisemetalworks.com/contact/",
        "quote": "We have been serving Boise, Idaho including the Treasure Valley Communities of Meridian, Eagle, Nampa – Caldwell and Eastern Oregon since 1994."
