    },
    {
      "problem": "Staff time spent answering repetitive phone inquiries about shop capabilities, material availability, minimum job sizes, and standard code dimensions.",
      "label": "hypothesis",
      "basis": "The company maintains an FAQ page addressing basic questions on shop rates, small jobs, materials, and stair/railing specifications, suggesting callers ask these questions regularly."
